description	"Kyle Katarn

A Force-sensitive mercenary who must choose his own path.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 10% faster RoF
- Lightsaber (Jedi Knight Spec)
-- Saber Defense (3)
-- Blaster Defense (1)
-- Blaster Deflect (2)
-- 42% less Red/8% more Blue damage
-- 25% more special damage
-- EX Saber Throw (2) ^3[CS1]
--- 33% more damage
- Kyle's Bryar Blaster Pistol (2)
-- 25% more charged FP drain
-- 20% less velocity
- Thermal Grenade (3)
- Stun Baton (2)

^8Attributes:
- Bunny Hop (1)
- Slow Faller
- Dexterity (1)
- Force Block (1)
- Force Focus (1)
- Uncivilized"